    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d305">

                <pb facs="0271" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1864p3/pg251"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Geofroy</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-11-15"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 15, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to your note of the 1st instant,
                    relative to the remonstrance of Messrs. Brulaton &amp; Company, of New Orleans,
                    against the exaction of certain duties, I have the honor to inform you that a
                    copy of the correspondence concerning this case will be communicated to the
                    proper committee of Congress at the next session.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">L. de Geofroy</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
